    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7h-NAH",
      "title": "feat: U19 permissionless flip for karst-u19-alpha + beta-0 correction (CANNON_KONA)",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1447,
      "body": "Split out of #1440. Contains the **karst-u19-alpha** permissionless rollout, the **karst-u19-beta-0** permissioned correction, and the `SetDisputeGameImpl` template extension they need. The ink/uni standard-chain U19 tasks and the OPCMUpgradeV700 / SuperchainAddressRegistry fixes stay in #1440.\n\n## Tasks (Sepolia, shared PAO Safe `0x8E851F7d8bAeaD95F592847a020cAC7A062dafd9`)\n\n| # | Chain | Action | Template |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 092 | karst-u19-alpha-1 | wire CANNON_KONA (8) reusing `0x2DDA` + alpha kona prestate `0x03ff5c52…`; permissioned (1) prestate → `0xdead`; game 0 stays `0x0` | SetDisputeGameImpl |\n| 093 | karst-u19-alpha-1 | `respectedGameType` → 8 | SetRespectedGameTypeTemplate |\n| 094 | karst-u19-alpha-0 | permissioned (1) prestate → `0xdead` (stays permissioned; no game 8) | SetDisputeGameImpl |\n| 095 | karst-u19-beta-0 | `respectedGameType` 8 → 1 (correction) | SetRespectedGameTypeTemplate |\n| 096 | karst-u19-beta-0 | zero CANNON_KONA (8) impl (correction) | SetDisputeGameImpl |\n\nResulting end-states match the U19 clarification (permissioned: respected 1 + no game 8; permissionless: respected 8 + kona, with game 1 fallback at `0xdead`):\n- **alpha-1** permissionless: g0=`0x0`, g1=`0xe1dF`/`0xdead`, g8=`0x2DDA`/kona, respected **8**\n- **alpha-0** permissioned: g0=`0x0`, g1=`0xe1dF`/`0xdead`, g8=`0x0`, respected **1**\n- **beta-0** permissioned (corrected from an earlier respected=8 / kona-wired state): g8=`0x0`, respected **1**\n\n## Template change\n`SetDisputeGameImpl` gains an optional `[[konaGameImplConfig]]` block (game type 8) — backward-compatible; existing FDG/PDG tasks unaffected. Supports wire (impl + 124-byte gameArgs) and disable (impl `0x0`).\n\n## Prestate\nAlpha kona prestate `0x03ff5c52c5a21d238e01c53158f4dcc26de9a35d138b010c14874699c7973b8d` built reproducibly from `kona-client/v1.6.0-rc.1` (monorepo @ `1e4fe99…`) embedding both alpha chains; embedded-config check passed; uploaded to `gs://oplabs-network-data/proofs/kona/cannon/`.\n\n## Verification & caveats\n- Full 092→096 stack simulates clean on `main`.\n- Hashes in each VALIDATION.md were captured at assumed sequential nonces 8–12. The Safe is shared across alpha-0/alpha-1/beta-0/beta-1; **re-verify nonce/hash at signing**. beta-0 (095/096) is intended as a **separate signing batch** — re-pin if executed ahead of the alpha rollout.\n- No regression test yet for the new `konaGameImplConfig` path (existing `Regression.t.sol` SetDisputeGameImpl coverage still passes).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-02T21:15:13Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 730,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7iQZ7F",
      "title": "feat: U19 templates — OPCMUpgradeV700 permissioned + SetDisputeGameArgs/Impl",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1448,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nPulls together the reusable template / src / test changes (no Sepolia task directories) from three in-flight U19 branches into a single PR:\n\n**From #1440**\n- `src/template/OPCMUpgradeV700.sol` — permissioned upgrade path\n- `src/SuperchainAddressRegistry.sol` — EthLockbox discovery via Portal\n- `src/tasks/MultisigTask.sol`\n- `test/registry/SuperchainAddressRegistry.t.sol` — registry test\n- `test/tasks/example/sep/038-opcm-upgrade-v700-permissioned/` — example task\n- permissioned regression test in `test/tasks/Regression.t.sol`\n\n**From #1447**\n- `src/template/SetDisputeGameImpl.sol` — template update\n\n**From #1445**\n- `src/template/SetDisputeGameArgs.sol` — new template\n- `test/tasks/example/sep/038-set-dispute-game-args/` — example task\n- regression test in `test/tasks/Regression.t.sol`\n\nThe actual `src/tasks/sep/090…096` task directories from those branches are intentionally **not** included here.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `forge build` — clean\n- `testRegressionCallDataMatches_OPCMUpgradeV700_U19_Permissioned` — PASS\n- `testRegressionCallDataMatches_SetDisputeGameArgs` — PASS\n- `testEthLockboxDiscoveredViaPortal` — PASS\n\n(The pre-existing `test_allowOverwrite_*` registry tests fail only on RPC historical-state availability, unrelated to this change.)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
